{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53384","headline":"答顺宗皇帝问 一 · 如满","name":"答顺宗皇帝问 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛从无爲来，灭向无爲去。\n法身等虚空，常住无心处。\n有念归无念，有住归无住。\n来爲衆生来，去爲衆生去。\n清净真如海，湛然体常住。\n智者善思惟，更勿生疑虑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"如满","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}